# 6z7y 1.3.1_beta - 2026-06-07
- split shared_utils.{c,h} into shared_utils{1,2}.{c,h}
  = shared_utils1.{c,h} for important utilities
  = shared_utils2.{c,h} for normal playback shared logic

* tomu
  - improve queue system (changed from fixed limit 200 array to fully dynamic memory allocation)
  - send name file & metadata to all clients before decoder

* tomucli
  - refactor queue system to dynamic list-based structure
  - add '-no-filter' option to skip audio filtering
  - add default audio format filter (can be disabled with -no-filter)
  - change file scanning flow: scan runs once, extracts all files, then sends them sequentially to server
  - change key handling from string input to ASCII-based input
  - fix key handling blocking issue
  - add '?' key for help / key bindings
  - upgrade progress config fields (done, current, remaining) from 1 char to 8-byte strings
  - add config option "color"
  - add recursive directory file extraction support

# 6z7y 1.3.0_beta - 2026-05-26

- Create ~/.config/tomu directory if not exists (now server/clients settings will be here)
- move discord_rich_presence to script python
- change client broadcast data from struct to JSON format

* tomu 
- Add config file support with discord_rich_presence toggle
- Add JSON broadcast with status + metadata fields
- Replace Audio_State with shared TomuStatus
- Add sleep_ms(100) to reduce CPU usage

* tomucli
- Add parse_json() for parsing server JSON status
- Move config to ~/.config/tomu/tomucli.conf
- Fix progress bar display (was commented out)
- Update field names (running, looping)
- Remove binary struct reading

# 6z7y 1.2.0_beta - 2026-05-11

